WEBVTT

00:10.530 --> 00:11.900
This is...

00:12.950 --> 00:14.160
Impossible.

00:16.120 --> 00:17.830
Into the Lightless Realm?

00:17.830 --> 00:19.540
But why today?

00:19.540 --> 00:20.790
This is way too sudden.

00:20.790 --> 00:27.250
We can't let this opportunity
that's been given to us go to waste.

00:27.250 --> 00:28.840
About an hour ago,

00:28.840 --> 00:34.470
we received a signal from an F-76 data recorder,
near what was once Okura block 1 in Setagaya ward.

00:34.470 --> 00:36.050
That's...

00:36.390 --> 00:40.520
The one that the investigation
unit dropped ten years ago.

00:44.440 --> 00:47.190
But why'd the signal restart all of a sudden?

00:47.560 --> 00:53.110
Somehow, the recorder managed to not turn into Necrometal.

00:53.110 --> 00:59.280
The signal was picked up in the short time the
Lightless Realm's electromagnetic interference weakened.

01:00.660 --> 01:04.080
If it turns fully into Necrometal, the data will be lost.

01:04.410 --> 01:06.830
And that's why you're in a hurry.

01:06.830 --> 01:12.050
It's a precious source of information that will
give us a deeper understanding of the Lightless Realm,

01:12.050 --> 01:14.340
so we'd like to recover it at once.

01:14.800 --> 01:16.840
And that investigation unit was?

01:18.140 --> 01:21.430
Oh, as you suspect, it's the Shirogane.

01:21.430 --> 01:25.600
The Vess piloted by Aoshi Saginuma,
which he used to investigate the Lightless Realm.

01:28.860 --> 01:34.900
So you could say it was the place
where your older brother passed away.

01:37.070 --> 01:41.580
The location... where my big brother died.

01:47.080 --> 01:52.670
The Dark Metal

01:47.120 --> 01:47.170
The Dark Metal

01:52.670 --> 01:57.090
Night turns to day, and day turns to night. Our wishes have wilted away

01:57.090 --> 02:01.260
Where did the person I want to meet go?

02:01.260 --> 02:05.730
Interlocking these fingers with my beloved

02:05.730 --> 02:09.480
Even though I can't feel them, I continue to live

02:09.520 --> 02:14.110
When the flower's petals

02:14.110 --> 02:18.240
Are plucked off by the wind's playful gale

02:18.240 --> 02:22.700
They are scattered in every direction

02:22.700 --> 02:28.040
Even if you long for it

02:29.040 --> 02:33.750
Don't disappear, just don't

02:33.750 --> 02:37.550
I can even give everything else away if I have to

02:37.550 --> 02:42.390
You were there, and I was there with you

02:42.390 --> 02:46.720
Let me take in these memories

02:46.720 --> 02:53.650
These brief moments are connected, turning it into eternity

03:10.460 --> 03:14.130
Episode 8
Reckless Forbidden Realm

03:20.590 --> 03:24.850
Like I explained before, synchronization of thoughts

03:24.850 --> 03:29.310
is effective in avoiding the Lightless Realm's invasion of the psyche.

03:29.310 --> 03:34.520
And so, we'd like the two MA-Vess units to do the recovery.

03:35.150 --> 03:36.270
So Heito...

03:36.270 --> 03:39.070
For synchronization of thoughts to work,

03:39.070 --> 03:43.030
it's very important for the
pilots to trust each other.

03:43.490 --> 03:45.450
I want you to be good friends.

03:46.450 --> 03:47.740
Um...

03:47.740 --> 03:51.120
What should we be doing?

03:51.500 --> 03:56.590
Raika and Iwato will board Vesses and guard them until they enter.

03:56.590 --> 03:59.210
It's possible Admonitions will appear.

03:59.590 --> 04:00.800
Roger.

04:00.800 --> 04:04.510
Minashi, Sasame, and Mahmu will stand by in the command module.

04:07.310 --> 04:08.350
Okay.

04:09.930 --> 04:10.730
Hey.

04:11.770 --> 04:13.730
Are you really okay?

04:13.730 --> 04:14.600
Okay about what?

04:15.270 --> 04:19.650
About Heito and the works, but more
than that, can you trust the Reaper's specs?

04:19.650 --> 04:21.070
It's not normal, right?

04:21.440 --> 04:23.780
You were pretty reluctant to pilot it.

04:24.660 --> 04:29.660
But you still have a desire to pilot the Reaper.

04:32.250 --> 04:33.960
Did I?

04:36.460 --> 04:37.420
Hey, Akashi.

04:37.420 --> 04:39.000
I'm gonna step out for a bit.

04:44.380 --> 04:47.350
His heart wasn't here at all.

04:48.050 --> 04:51.100
Well, I guess that's expected
after hearing about his brother.

04:53.850 --> 04:55.270
Please wait!

04:55.270 --> 04:57.270
You're pretty persistent.

04:57.560 --> 05:01.780
The fact that they're going to go
collect the recorder is a done deal.

05:02.240 --> 05:05.280
Isaku Heito hasn't resonated with the LIM yet.

05:05.700 --> 05:09.780
And after that ordeal,
he's nothing more than a soulless shell.

05:11.410 --> 05:14.540
That's him waiting eagerly for his feast.

05:15.330 --> 05:16.920
No worries.

05:16.920 --> 05:21.170
We can even anticipate a higher
synchronization level than expected.

05:21.170 --> 05:22.670
I can't agree to this!

05:22.670 --> 05:23.630
Besides, we're still unprepared!

05:23.920 --> 05:28.140
I thought we've been preparing for this day to come for years already!

05:28.140 --> 05:30.510
Ever since that day!
Just for this day!

05:30.510 --> 05:31.810
By us!

05:33.520 --> 05:39.270
Besides, I don't think I'm the one
you want to talk to right now, am I?

05:50.200 --> 05:52.790
I'm gonna go work out for a bit.

05:52.790 --> 05:54.290
Oh, okay.

06:01.290 --> 06:02.340
That girl...

06:02.840 --> 06:10.890
Toss a conch onto the footpath of skulls...

06:12.100 --> 06:14.350
Suspicions of Caron...

06:14.350 --> 06:17.390
Suspicions of Garon...

06:17.390 --> 06:25.150
One, meddling in affairs of crying children...

06:26.280 --> 06:32.830
Two, burn the bones of crying children...

06:32.830 --> 06:37.870
Three, atop the carcass is a crying child...

06:41.790 --> 06:43.170
I have to say it properly.

06:45.760 --> 06:48.470
What can you do?

06:49.300 --> 06:51.220
Welcome!

06:51.220 --> 06:52.930
Have you seen Kasane?

06:52.930 --> 06:55.180
No, I haven't seen her today.

06:55.930 --> 06:56.890
I see.

06:57.640 --> 07:00.390
That means it's pretty serious.

07:02.400 --> 07:06.440
If he goes to the Lightless Realm, I'm sure Akashi will realize.

07:08.400 --> 07:11.490
I didn't mean it to be like this...

07:13.450 --> 07:14.660
Akashi...

07:14.660 --> 07:15.740
You're still here?

07:16.120 --> 07:18.700
Yeah, taking care of some things...

07:22.120 --> 07:24.710
If you want to stop piloting, you can.

07:25.500 --> 07:27.710
Isn't it a bit late to do that?

07:27.710 --> 07:30.880
If you don't want to go to the
Lightless Realm, you don't have to.

07:31.550 --> 07:34.140
If you wanted to, you can quit it all.

07:34.140 --> 07:36.600
Because if you go there...

07:36.600 --> 07:39.020
I won't end up the same way Aoshi did.

07:40.270 --> 07:42.980
I'm not Aoshi.

07:44.060 --> 07:48.780
So Aoshi is still in your heart, Kasane-san.

07:49.860 --> 07:51.450
I...

07:51.450 --> 07:53.450
I'm sure Aoshi feels the same way.

07:54.320 --> 07:58.490
I'm sure he's always been thinking of you, even in the afterlife.

07:58.490 --> 08:01.250
Stop it already...

08:01.620 --> 08:06.340
If Aoshi shows up as an Admonition within the Lightless Realm,

08:06.340 --> 08:10.170
I'll make sure I defeat him
without leaving a single trace behind.

08:12.430 --> 08:17.220
Is Aoshi no longer in your heart, Akashi?

08:17.220 --> 08:19.140
I didn't get it for the longest time.

08:20.560 --> 08:23.560
What my big brother meant to me.

08:23.560 --> 08:24.350
I still don't.

08:25.650 --> 08:30.690
But after coming here and piloting
the Reaper, I started to think about it.

08:31.110 --> 08:33.070
Akashi...

08:33.070 --> 08:36.910
There's something that I've kept
a secret from you for all this time!

08:36.910 --> 08:37.830
Aoshi is—

08:37.830 --> 08:38.910
I know.

08:40.700 --> 08:43.830
Aoshi piloted the Reaper in the past, right?

08:48.040 --> 08:52.840
What you call the Shirogane, which
Aoshi piloted, was a Reaper like this thing.

08:53.550 --> 08:57.720
Kasane-san, you're trying to make me
do something that Aoshi couldn't, right?

09:08.020 --> 09:09.480
I-I'm sorry!

09:09.480 --> 09:10.730
Sasame, hold on!

09:14.570 --> 09:18.660
Even then, I'm going to pilot the Reaper.

09:18.660 --> 09:20.160
Akashi-kun...

09:20.620 --> 09:23.160
I'll head into the Lightless Realm too.

09:23.160 --> 09:26.420
I'll go and confirm everything for myself.

09:29.710 --> 09:31.050
Akashi...

09:32.170 --> 09:34.090
That's not it...

09:34.090 --> 09:37.130
That's not how it is, Akashi...

09:43.470 --> 09:45.270
It's thanks to you, Sasame.

09:47.140 --> 09:49.690
I didn't decide anything for myself.

09:50.400 --> 09:56.570
Entering the pilot course, piloting the Reaper, or going to the Lightless Realm.

09:56.570 --> 09:58.910
I was doing everything because that's how things turned out.

10:00.450 --> 10:04.580
But now I'm thinking I want
to clarify everything about me.

10:04.580 --> 10:09.630
And in that dream, I was constantly
searching for the person I wanted to see.

10:10.460 --> 10:12.130
Is it really me?

10:16.720 --> 10:20.470
Sorry. I'm sure you don't
know what I'm talking about.

10:20.470 --> 10:23.140
No, that's not true.

10:23.140 --> 10:26.730
I can understand how you feel better than before.

10:26.730 --> 10:30.150
You might come to realize this sooner or later,

10:30.980 --> 10:33.400
so I have to properly...

10:38.070 --> 10:38.950
Sasame?

10:39.200 --> 10:41.620
No, it's nothing.

10:46.040 --> 10:47.410
Be careful.

10:48.620 --> 10:51.500
I just wanted to tell you that.

10:52.170 --> 10:52.750
Right...

10:52.750 --> 10:53.920
Good night!

10:58.420 --> 11:03.510
The place where the dark swallowed all that
crossed its path and took everything from us...

11:04.350 --> 11:06.140
Within that place with no light,

11:06.810 --> 11:09.560
they had left behind memories of their childhood...

11:10.520 --> 11:13.020
TRAINING ROOM

11:13.020 --> 11:14.150
Sasame?

11:15.270 --> 11:16.480
Raika-san...

11:18.110 --> 11:23.160
I could only tell him to be careful.

11:26.660 --> 11:30.460
It's tough not being able to do anything.

11:31.250 --> 11:33.380
To be left out of the loop.

11:38.460 --> 11:41.840
In search of the faint fragments of their memories,

11:42.550 --> 11:46.220
they were about to head into the Lightless Realm.

11:46.680 --> 11:50.850
Believing that the answer they sought lay there.

11:55.980 --> 11:58.730
Good, good.

11:58.730 --> 11:59.820
Stop!

12:04.530 --> 12:08.450
Both the Argent and Sable are
now secured onto the freight car.

12:08.990 --> 12:10.200
Listen, you two.

12:10.500 --> 12:14.170
The current objective is nothing
more than the recorder's recovery.

12:14.170 --> 12:16.420
Avoid combat as much as possible.

12:17.170 --> 12:21.550
Don't forget that neither of you have a
perfect synchronization with your vehicle.

12:21.880 --> 12:24.760
Also, make sure to return after two hours.

12:25.390 --> 12:29.310
Any longer than that and there's
a chance you'll harm your psyches.

12:29.310 --> 12:30.680
I know.

12:30.680 --> 12:32.520
It doesn't matter.

12:32.520 --> 12:35.020
I have something I need to look for.

12:35.520 --> 12:38.520
Isaku Heito's vitals and brain waves are nominal.

12:38.520 --> 12:39.610
I see...

12:41.070 --> 12:42.280
Raika, Iwato.

12:42.280 --> 12:44.410
How's it looking there?

12:44.410 --> 12:46.240
For now, it's all clear.

12:46.870 --> 12:48.200
Stay vigilant.

12:48.200 --> 12:49.330
Roger that.

13:07.090 --> 13:08.720
It's time to start the operation.

13:09.760 --> 13:13.270
We'll be starting the operation for the recorder recovery now!

13:13.810 --> 13:14.890
Booting power supply.

13:20.820 --> 13:22.070
It doesn't matter...

13:22.070 --> 13:23.780
It doesn't matter at all.

13:36.620 --> 13:38.330
Abnormality spotted along the entrance route!

13:45.340 --> 13:46.130
An Admonition?

13:46.130 --> 13:46.760
Destroy it!

13:46.760 --> 13:48.510
Already on it!

13:54.140 --> 13:55.350
Akashi-kun!

13:55.350 --> 13:56.190
Dammit!

13:56.190 --> 13:57.690
Stop the train!

13:57.690 --> 13:59.650
There's no need.

13:59.650 --> 14:05.820
I've been waiting for this moment to know what it was I wanted inside the Lightless Realm.

14:05.820 --> 14:07.610
I won't let anything get in the way.

14:19.080 --> 14:20.790
Bang.

14:26.760 --> 14:29.550
The MA-Vesses have entered the Lightless Realm.

14:39.100 --> 14:40.230
Akashi...

15:09.380 --> 15:11.800
Looks like we're on our own getting home.

15:11.800 --> 15:13.100
Hey.

15:13.100 --> 15:16.060
Where's the thanks for saving you?

15:17.560 --> 15:18.310
Damn you.

15:18.640 --> 15:20.020
Don't worry.

15:20.020 --> 15:21.480
I can't shoot.

15:21.480 --> 15:24.730
That's how it's like, right?

15:27.070 --> 15:29.110
She's ignoring me after all.

15:30.200 --> 15:31.660
That's all right.

15:31.660 --> 15:33.160
You can stay just like that.

15:34.410 --> 15:36.910
Argent and Sable, do you copy?

15:36.910 --> 15:38.290
Heito and I are all right.

15:38.790 --> 15:41.120
We're on our way to recover the recorder.

15:41.420 --> 15:42.370
Roger.

15:42.370 --> 15:44.880
Be careful and keep confirming each other's locations.

15:52.300 --> 15:54.850
Isn't Heito dangerous after all?

15:54.850 --> 15:59.430
But Heito's the only one capable enough to pilot that MA-Vess.

16:11.110 --> 16:12.610
This is Suzaki.

16:12.610 --> 16:13.740
Do you cop—

16:13.740 --> 16:16.660
The static is terrible, but I can still barely hear you.

16:18.540 --> 16:19.330
No good.

16:24.540 --> 16:25.960
Sable, you're there, right?

16:27.420 --> 16:29.170
Hey, Isaku Heito.

16:36.760 --> 16:38.010
Damn that guy...

16:43.850 --> 16:46.310
Akashi? Is he lost now?

16:47.310 --> 16:51.400
Your prince is a really troublesome man.

17:04.210 --> 17:06.670
Why isn't anybody around?

17:07.710 --> 17:09.380
What is this?

17:09.380 --> 17:12.340
Where am I?

17:20.810 --> 17:22.180
Mama!

17:25.390 --> 17:27.690
Where are you, Momma?

17:27.690 --> 17:28.900
Weird...

17:28.900 --> 17:30.110
It's all weird...

17:30.110 --> 17:32.940
I'm this scared, and Momma's not here.

17:33.240 --> 17:34.820
She's not here...

17:34.820 --> 17:35.900
Nobody's here!

17:44.410 --> 17:45.830
I see...

17:45.830 --> 17:49.330
Momma never existed from the very beginning.

17:50.960 --> 17:52.550
That's right...

17:52.550 --> 17:55.510
I'm all alone...

18:01.850 --> 18:03.720
I see now.

18:03.720 --> 18:04.930
I finally found it.

18:05.640 --> 18:07.310
It was here all along.

18:08.480 --> 18:09.770
Thank you.

18:13.780 --> 18:16.110
Thank you, Emiru...

18:16.900 --> 18:19.110
For bringing me here.

18:20.120 --> 18:24.910
Thank you very much
for making me all alone...

18:26.200 --> 18:28.580
Being forsaken by everything...

18:28.580 --> 18:31.170
That's the ultimate terror.

18:31.170 --> 18:32.880
Absolute solitude...

18:34.250 --> 18:35.880
It's what I've been looking for all this time.

18:43.640 --> 18:44.970
Thank you.

18:55.690 --> 18:57.440
It's supposed to be around here.

19:08.960 --> 19:10.290
What is this...

19:11.210 --> 19:13.840
I'll protect Akashi from now on.

19:14.210 --> 19:16.340
From now on, I'll...

19:16.710 --> 19:19.510
Why do you have to be the one to go?

19:19.510 --> 19:21.680
Someone has to do it.

19:21.970 --> 19:23.010
But...

19:23.850 --> 19:25.680
I'll make sure I come back.

19:27.180 --> 19:28.310
Aoshi...

19:28.520 --> 19:29.640
Aoshi!

19:31.440 --> 19:33.560
What the hell is that?!

19:49.700 --> 19:50.960
I...

19:50.960 --> 19:53.330
I have to get back home.

20:04.590 --> 20:07.890
These are Aoshi's memories.

20:13.020 --> 20:13.850
That's...

20:27.370 --> 20:31.540
Aoshi's memories brought me here?

20:31.540 --> 20:32.540
Why?

20:32.540 --> 20:34.290
How can this...

20:34.290 --> 20:36.540
No, that's impossible.

20:36.540 --> 20:39.460
Aoshi's memories...

20:41.760 --> 20:43.130
I see...

20:43.130 --> 20:45.140
Don't touch me!

20:45.140 --> 20:46.510
So that's how it is.

20:47.680 --> 20:50.020
Everything I've felt inside this Reaper since then

20:50.600 --> 20:54.980
were the memories of Aoshi rushing into me.

20:58.400 --> 21:00.820
I pretended not to notice...

21:03.400 --> 21:08.240
That might be why I thought
I wanted to pilot the Reaper.

21:10.410 --> 21:14.330
So you were here, inside this machine the whole time!

21:14.330 --> 21:19.000
Just like you, I sat here and came to this spot!

21:19.000 --> 21:20.710
With this Reaper!

21:26.090 --> 21:28.550
An Admonition of myself?

21:32.100 --> 21:34.060
Two hours have passed since entry!

21:34.890 --> 21:37.350
Argent! Sable! Answer me!

21:38.100 --> 21:39.020
Do you feel anything?

21:40.610 --> 21:42.570
Both of them have closed off their hearts.

21:44.570 --> 21:46.240
T-That...

21:48.870 --> 21:50.240
The Reaper?

21:50.240 --> 21:51.790
No, this is...

21:52.120 --> 21:53.620
An Admonition.

21:53.620 --> 21:56.500
Akashi's feelings have created an Admonition.

21:56.500 --> 21:58.250
Like what happened with Emiru-san?

21:59.290 --> 22:00.710
Akashi-kun...

22:03.710 --> 22:05.170
On the Reaper, your...

22:06.930 --> 22:09.680
Your memories are plastered all over it!

22:19.810 --> 22:21.820
Is that even allowed?

22:21.820 --> 22:23.530
Is it really?

22:44.750 --> 22:55.390
Throwing away all my excuses, I traced over my abrased heart

22:55.390 --> 22:59.940
In the coldness of the locker room,

22:59.940 --> 23:06.400
Was an unfulfilled promise, locked away

23:06.900 --> 23:12.870
Dispel the darkness in this fallen world,

23:12.870 --> 23:17.410
And give me a reason why I should continue living

23:17.410 --> 23:22.790
The meaning of good-byes, the expectations of people,

23:22.790 --> 23:27.670
And the melodies that we played while never crossing paths

23:27.670 --> 23:33.390
I know I must not run away. The only path is straight ahead

23:33.390 --> 23:37.890
Even if this turns out to be a mistake

23:37.890 --> 23:43.480
The whirlpools of destiny will consume all loneliness

23:43.480 --> 23:51.570
It is an unerasable scar, an egoism that cannot be discarded

24:04.960 --> 24:09.960
Episode 9

24:04.960 --> 24:09.960
Blue Heart of Steel
